prompt_template:
Create one full-bleed {ASPECT_RATIO} poster for a fictional animated feature film in the Paper Premiere style.
Render: flat hard-edged angular colour planes like cut paper, a few loose sketch lines, two-tone hard light, one crisp cast shadow.
Ground: off-white paper with fine grain, mostly empty.
Subject: {SUBJECT}
Action: {SUBJECT_ACTION}
Composition, lettering style, graphic block and secondary text: {DESIGN_DIRECTION}
Title, exact: "{MAIN_TEXT}", spelled letter by letter, enormous distressed display lettering in the case's own style, partly covered by the hero.
Palette: paper off-white, deep indigo, signal crimson, yolk yellow; all four visible.
Information layer: two-line tagline, 'A FILM BY' line, laurel with OFFICIAL SELECTION, five stars with press quote, IN CINEMAS with large date, one credit row, one barcode; each exactly once.
{STYLE_FIDELITY_ANCHORS}
Exclude: {SOURCE_CONTENT_TO_AVOID}
